# Vercel CLI deploy exclusions. Mirrors the large/irrelevant paths in .gitignore so `vercel
# --prod` can't accidentally sweep them into the upload again, regardless of git tracking
# state. See .gitignore for why these specific paths are excluded.

node_modules
.git

# Course-catalog build inputs — never referenced by index.html, only used once to generate
# assets/images/unique/. 426MB + 107MB + 132MB of dead weight for a deploy.
course-catalog-site/source-docs
course-catalog-site/assets/images/raw-extracted

# Local scratch / one-off scripts and SQL — not part of the served app.
scratch/
scratch_db.js
fee_corrections/
_*.py
_*.sh
